Package: fiabilitylab
Type: Package
Title: FiabilityLab: Comprehensive Reliability and Agreement Analysis
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Arquímedes De León", "Chacón Chacón", email = "arquimedeschacon@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(affiliation = "Universidad Católica Andrés Bello (UCAB), Caracas, Venezuela"))
Author: Chacón Chacón, Arquímedes De León [Universidad Católica Andrés Bello (UCAB), Caracas, Venezuela]
Maintainer: Chacón Chacón, Arquímedes De León <arquimedeschacon@gmail.com>
Description: FiabilityLab is a pedagogical jamovi module for evaluating reliability,
    internal consistency, inter-rater agreement, confirmatory-factor-based
    (SEM) reliability, and measurement invariance across groups. It integrates
    a Library and Bibliography system to teach the theoretical foundations and
    assumptions behind each statistic. Designed for academic, applied, and
    pedagogical use, with bilingual reporting (English/Español) and
    interpretable diagnostic guidance.
